  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SINOCHEM Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support China&#x2019;s work to implement the Stockholm Convention and the Minamata Convention through regulation of emissions of persistent organic pollutants and mercury. It is jointly implemented by Foreign Economic Cooperation Office of China&#x2019;s Ministry of Ecology and Environment and Norwegian Environment Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
